{
    "title": "Hero of Aethric | Classic RPG",
    "description": "INSPIRED BY CLASSIC TURN BASED RPG GAMES\r\nIn this nostalgia fueled, free to play MMORPG: explore a new world, enjoy turn-based combat and create the perfect build to take on a world ravaged by a cataclysmic event known as the Falling.\r\n\r\nBuild your own origin town and set forth on a sprawling RPG where you will travel across a hand-crafted game world. Uncover the story of a fallen land, unlock new classes, and become the Hero of Aethric!\r\n\r\nHERO OF AETHRIC FEATURES:\r\n\u2605 Turn based RPG battles - Collect skills and spells to utilize in strategic turn-based combat. Your spell loadout might make the difference between victory or defeat in battle!\r\n\u2605 Class System \u2013 gain experience and unlock over 50 unique classes and specializations. Start as a thief, mage or warrior and choose your path.\r\n\u2605 Collect loot \u2013 combine armor, weapons, and spells to craft the perfect build to take down your foes. Each new monthly event brings new loot that aims to shake your loadout up!\r\n\u2605 World Raids \u2013 portals to other realms will open allowing you to join thousands of other Heroes from across the world to face off against raid bosses in MMORPG battles\r\n\u2605 Pixel RPG \u2013 pixel art style that will remind you of classic, old-school RPG games.\r\n\u2605 Story Campaign \u2013 meet new characters that will aid you in your quest. Discover the world of Aethric and bring peace to these fallen lands.\r\n\u2605 Kingdom gameplay \u2013join a guild with other players to take on unique quests and raids.\r\n\u2605 Free to play \u2013 we believe in no paywalls, ads, or aggressive monetization - play through the game entirely for free!\r\n...and much more!\r\n\r\nAN EVER-CHANGING GAME WORLD\r\nWith new content released every month. you will get to watch the lands of Aethric evolve over time. New questlines, events and features will be introduced that change the way you play the game. From researching dragons to sealing the gates to the underworld, this MMORPG will surprise you month after month.\r\n\r\nCHOOSE YOUR OWN ADVENTURE\r\nTeam up with friends or tackle things alone. Fight in the arena or go dungeon crawling with your party. The choice is yours on how your adventure will play out with every choice working towards leveling up your character. Unlock new gear and classes to create diverse and complex character builds. This is an RPG where you get to play your way!\r\n\r\nTOWN BUILDING\r\nMost RPG games have memorable origin towns where your adventure starts. In this RPG, you get to create your own! As you adventure through the world you can always return home and expand your town with new buildings that offer you different benefits. Keep townsfolk happy and they\u2019ll provide you with gifts to aid you on your journey.\r\n\r\nMULTIPLAYER TURN-BASED RPG\r\nJoin up with your friends and tackle the game together. With up to 4 player co-op available you can play through the entire game alongside other players. Join a guild in order to team up for difficult raids and dungeons! It\u2019s dangerous to go alone, so grab a friend and explore the lands of Aethric side by side.\r\n\r\nBEGIN YOUR ADVENTURE\r\nA fantasy adventure at your fingertips with endless amounts of gameplay. With monthly updates including features, questlines and events we can't wait for you to see what Aethric has to offer - we\u2019re excited to meet you, Hero!\r\n\r\n\r\nNOTE FROM DEVELOPER\r\nAs a follow up to Orna: the GPS RPG, we aim to build and evolve this game alongside you. We\u2019re a studio that believes in creating games without any paywalls or forced advertisements. We always listen to feedback to make our games the best they can possibly be. We welcome you to the community!\r\n\r\nHero of Aethric is an MMORPG and will require an internet connection.\r\n\r\nBe sure to join our Discord and be part of the conversation!\r\n\r\nOfficial Subreddit: https://www.reddit.com/r/OrnaRPG\r\nOfficial Discord: https://discord.gg/MSmTAMnrpm",
    "descriptionHTML": "INSPIRED BY CLASSIC TURN BASED RPG GAMES<br>In this nostalgia fueled, free to play MMORPG: explore a new world, enjoy turn-based combat and create the perfect build to take on a world ravaged by a cataclysmic event known as the Falling.<br><br>Build your own origin town and set forth on a sprawling RPG where you will travel across a hand-crafted game world. Uncover the story of a fallen land, unlock new classes, and become the Hero of Aethric!<br><br>HERO OF AETHRIC FEATURES:<br>\u2605 Turn based RPG battles - Collect skills and spells to utilize in strategic turn-based combat. Your spell loadout might make the difference between victory or defeat in battle!<br>\u2605 Class System \u2013 gain experience and unlock over 50 unique classes and specializations. Start as a thief, mage or warrior and choose your path.<br>\u2605 Collect loot \u2013 combine armor, weapons, and spells to craft the perfect build to take down your foes. Each new monthly event brings new loot that aims to shake your loadout up!<br>\u2605 World Raids \u2013 portals to other realms will open allowing you to join thousands of other Heroes from across the world to face off against raid bosses in MMORPG battles<br>\u2605 Pixel RPG \u2013 pixel art style that will remind you of classic, old-school RPG games.<br>\u2605 Story Campaign \u2013 meet new characters that will aid you in your quest. Discover the world of Aethric and bring peace to these fallen lands.<br>\u2605 Kingdom gameplay \u2013join a guild with other players to take on unique quests and raids.<br>\u2605 Free to play \u2013 we believe in no paywalls, ads, or aggressive monetization - play through the game entirely for free!<br>...and much more!<br><br>AN EVER-CHANGING GAME WORLD<br>With new content released every month. you will get to watch the lands of Aethric evolve over time. New questlines, events and features will be introduced that change the way you play the game. From researching dragons to sealing the gates to the underworld, this MMORPG will surprise you month after month.<br><br>CHOOSE YOUR OWN ADVENTURE<br>Team up with friends or tackle things alone. Fight in the arena or go dungeon crawling with your party. The choice is yours on how your adventure will play out with every choice working towards leveling up your character. Unlock new gear and classes to create diverse and complex character builds. This is an RPG where you get to play your way!<br><br>TOWN BUILDING<br>Most RPG games have memorable origin towns where your adventure starts. In this RPG, you get to create your own! As you adventure through the world you can always return home and expand your town with new buildings that offer you different benefits. Keep townsfolk happy and they\u2019ll provide you with gifts to aid you on your journey.<br><br>MULTIPLAYER TURN-BASED RPG<br>Join up with your friends and tackle the game together. With up to 4 player co-op available you can play through the entire game alongside other players. Join a guild in order to team up for difficult raids and dungeons! It\u2019s dangerous to go alone, so grab a friend and explore the lands of Aethric side by side.<br><br>BEGIN YOUR ADVENTURE<br>A fantasy adventure at your fingertips with endless amounts of gameplay. With monthly updates including features, questlines and events we can&#39;t wait for you to see what Aethric has to offer - we\u2019re excited to meet you, Hero!<br><br><br>NOTE FROM DEVELOPER<br>As a follow up to Orna: the GPS RPG, we aim to build and evolve this game alongside you. We\u2019re a studio that believes in creating games without any paywalls or forced advertisements. We always listen to feedback to make our games the best they can possibly be. We welcome you to the community!<br><br>Hero of Aethric is an MMORPG and will require an internet connection.<br><br>Be sure to join our Discord and be part of the conversation!<br><br>Official Subreddit: https://www.reddit.com/r/OrnaRPG<br>Official Discord: https://discord.gg/MSmTAMnrpm",
